# test-spec-tasks.json Schema

```json
{
  "generatedAt": "ISO-8601 timestamp",
  "mode": "acceptance|development",
  "cases": ["TC-P0-001"],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "TASK-001",
      "sourceCaseId": "TC-P0-001",
      "priority": "P0|P1|P2|P3",
      "layer": "unit|integration|api|e2e",
      "platform": "web|android-real|android-emulator|ios-sim|ios-real",
      "targetFile": "tests/api/module/tc-p0-001.sh",
      "testName": "可读的测试名称",
      "command": "可复制粘贴执行的命令",
      "assertions": ["断言1", "断言2"],
      "oracle": {
        "ui": [],
        "api": ["API 验证基准"],
        "db": ["数据库验证基准"],
        "sideEffects": [],
        "negativeAssertions": ["负向断言"]
      },
      "evidenceRefs": {
        "viewTree": ["UI 断言原文"],
        "screenshot": ["自绘 UI 断言原文"],
        "logcat": ["无崩溃 / 无 ANR 断言原文"]
      },
      "data": {
        "pendingId": "<PENDING_ID>",
        "description": "测试数据说明"
      },
      "implementationStatus": "implemented|not-implemented",
      "executionStatus": "not-run|passed|failed|blocked",
      "evidence": [],
      "blocker": null,
      "nextAction": null
    }
  ]
}
```

`platform` 缺省为 `web`。`android-real` / `android-emulator` 表示 Android 移动端 E2E；
`ios-sim` / `ios-real` 已接入检测与证据契约，但需要 macOS + Xcode，且**尚未实测**。
执行细节见 `references/mobile-e2e-integration.md`。

`evidenceRefs` 是移动端 task 的必填映射：每条 oracle 断言的原文都要出现在
`viewTree` / `screenshot` / `logcat`（iOS 可用 `deviceLog` / `syslog`）之一的数组里。
门禁只校验映射是否齐全，映射是否合理由代码审查判断。
